  "title": "No Man's Sky Launch on iPhone and iPad",
  "summary": "Hello Games announced that its long-running sci-fi exploration game will be coming to iOS, with versions for both the iPhone and iPad available starting on October 28th. The App Store celebrates Indie Games Week, highlighting these games as part of the event.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Hello Games announced the launch of its sci-fi game 'No Man’s Sky' on iOS, with versions available for iPhone and iPad starting on October 28th.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The game includes popular indie titles such as Sifu, Vampire Crawlers, Dome Keeper, and Little Kitty, which will be available on iOS.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The release coincides with the App Store's celebration of Indie Games Week.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
